@startuml 20-tp-failsafe-injection-map
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Diagram 20: Failsafe Test Injection Points on Mission FSM
' Shows where each SITL failsafe test injects a fault
' MC-TP-001 §6  TP-ST-002 through TP-ST-006, TP-ST-010
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

title "20 — Failsafe Test Injection Points\nSITL Fault Injection on Mission Phase FSM  ·  MC-TP-001 §6"

skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFBFC
skinparam DefaultFontColor #1C2334
skinparam DefaultFontSize 10
skinparam TitleFontSize 13
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam RoundCorner 8

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #D8E8F8
  BorderColor #3D5A80
  BorderThickness 1.5
  FontSize 10
  FontStyle bold
  ArrowColor #3D5A80
  ArrowFontSize 9
  ArrowFontColor #2A4060
  StartColor #1A3860
  EndColor #1A3860
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFAE8
  BorderColor #C09030
  FontSize 9
}

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' MISSION PHASE FSM
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
[*] --> PREFLIGHT

PREFLIGHT : Pre-arm checks
PREFLIGHT --> ARMING : GCS ARM_AUTHORISE\n+ checks pass

ARMING : FCC arming sequence
ARMING --> TAKEOFF : arming_state = ARMED

TAKEOFF : FCC AUTO_TAKEOFF
TAKEOFF --> INGRESS : altitude reached\n+ GCS INGRESS cmd

INGRESS : Formation keeping\nto muster waypoint
INGRESS --> MUSTER : FCC mission item\ncomplete

MUSTER : Formation hold\nPeer state exchange
MUSTER --> ISR_SELECTION : quorum met

state ISR_SELECTION #FFE8C0
ISR_SELECTION : Coordinator election\nScoring · ISR_RESULT
ISR_SELECTION --> VORONOI_PARTITION : all ACKs received

state VORONOI_PARTITION #FFE8C0
VORONOI_PARTITION : Fortune's algorithm\nConsensus protocol
VORONOI_PARTITION --> SEARCH : consensus OK\n+ path uploaded

state SEARCH #C8E8C8
SEARCH : AUTO_MISSION\nCoverage path\nDetection active
SEARCH --> RETURN : GCS END_MISSION\nor mission complete

RETURN : AUTO_RTL
RETURN --> LAND : at home point

LAND : AUTO_LAND
LAND --> [*] : disarmed

state FAULT #FFD0D0
FAULT : RTL or HOLD\nGCS notified
FAULT --> [*] : disarmed

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' NOMINAL ABORT
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
SEARCH --> FAULT : GCS ABORT (any phase)
INGRESS --> FAULT : GCS ABORT
MUSTER --> FAULT : GCS ABORT

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' FAULT INJECTION ANNOTATIONS
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

note right of SEARCH #FFE0E0
  <b>Fault Injection Points</b>
  during SEARCH phase:
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-002</b>  GCS Link Loss
  Inject: iptables DROP GCS ports
  Trigger: 10 s timeout → HOLD
  Assert: fault_mask = GCS_TIMEOUT
  Recovery: GCS reconnect → cmd
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-003</b>  Low Battery RTL
  Inject: mock battery_status 18%
  Trigger: immediate (< 2 s)
  Assert: nav_state = AUTO_RTL
  Assert: STATUSTEXT WARN received
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-004</b>  Manager Crash
  Inject: docker kill mc-mission-exec
  Trigger: 5 s watchdog → restart
  Assert: heartbeat resumes < 15 s
  Assert: FCC holds during restart
  Extension: 3× crash → RTL
  Assert: fault_mask = MANAGER_DEAD
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-005</b>  Peer Drone Lost
  Inject: stop Drone 2 MC stack
  Trigger: 3 s → re-partition
  Assert: voronoi_cell updated
  Assert: new path covers full polygon
  ─────────────────────────
  <b>TP-ST-006</b>  FCC Comms Lost
  Inject: docker kill mc-fcc-bridge
  Trigger: 1 s → FCC_LINK_LOST
  Assert: phase = FAULT
  Assert: STATUSTEXT CRITICAL
end note

note left of ISR_SELECTION #FFE0E0
  <b>TP-ST-010</b>  Coordinator Failover
  Inject: kill Drone 1 MC stack
  at entry to ISR_SELECTION
  Trigger: 8 s failover timeout
  Assert: Drone 2 broadcasts ISR_RESULT
  Assert: election completes correctly
  Assert: phase proceeds to VORONOI
end note

note left of PREFLIGHT #FFE8CC
  <b>TP-UT-011</b>  Pre-arm Check
  (unit test, no SITL)
  Inject: battery_remaining = 0.28
  Assert: pre_arm_checks() = false
  Assert: ARMING not entered
end note

note right of FAULT #FFD0D0
  <b>All failsafe tests ultimately</b>
  <b>resolve through this state.</b>
  ─────────────────────────
  TP-ST-003: Low battery → RTL → LAND
  TP-ST-004 (ext.): 3× crash → RTL
  TP-ST-006: FCC lost → FAULT declared
  ─────────────────────────
  S1 severity: any failsafe that does
  NOT reach expected safe state.
end note

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' EXPECTED OUTCOMES LEGEND
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
legend right
  | Test | Injection Phase | Injected Fault | Expected outcome |
  | <b>TP-ST-002</b> | SEARCH | GCS link DROP | HOLD until recovery |
  | <b>TP-ST-003</b> | SEARCH | battery = 18% | RTL immediately |
  | <b>TP-ST-004</b> | SEARCH | manager kill | restart < 15 s; HOLD |
  | <b>TP-ST-004 ext.</b> | SEARCH | 3× manager kill | RTL; MANAGER_DEAD |
  | <b>TP-ST-005</b> | SEARCH | peer MC stop | re-partition → new path |
  | <b>TP-ST-006</b> | SEARCH | fcc-bridge kill | FAULT; STATUSTEXT CRITICAL |
  | <b>TP-ST-010</b> | ISR_SELECTION | coordinator kill | Drone 2 takes over |
endlegend

@enduml
